WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.760
Your inventory data is already there.

00:01.760 --> 00:04.280
Supplier sheets, counts, sales exports.

00:04.280 --> 00:08.320
Connect Spark to ChatGPT or Claude through MCP.

00:08.320 --> 00:11.320
Your assistant reads raw data, understands columns,

00:11.320 --> 00:14.720
matches your catalog, and calls Spark's tools.

00:14.720 --> 00:18.520
Seed items, import history, set stock, keep custom fields.

00:18.520 --> 00:21.400
Spark previews changes and flags exceptions.

00:21.400 --> 00:23.120
You review. You approve.

00:23.120 --> 00:25.240
Raw files become live inventory

00:25.240 --> 00:27.640
without rebuilding another CSV.

00:27.640 --> 00:29.880
Spark Inventory. Connect your assistant.
